{"id": "official:sentence:7ce4ce49-6b86-49b7-89c5-0e0ee251147f", "text": "我很想看看你摘下这些苹果的树。", "shortMeaning": "我很想看看你摘苹果的那棵树。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1df9bacd-38e0-4913-938f-473c11169459", "text": "我很想能够穿上一条像这样的裙子。但为此，我必须变得更瘦。", "shortMeaning": "我很想穿上这样的裙子，但必须再瘦些。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:69d78bf1-a33b-4ece-b7ea-24cc37b71640", "text": "我很抱歉今天不能过来。", "shortMeaning": "我很抱歉今天来不了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a8ee8899-5786-4d0e-bb59-64ee3f3cf44e", "text": "我很抱歉今天您来的时候没能见您。", "shortMeaning": "很抱歉今天您来时没能见您。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ae6d0f29-b73d-4010-a749-668f1b92e06d", "text": "我很抱歉那么晚回家。", "shortMeaning": "很抱歉我回家那么晚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:70a1aa20-747d-4150-bda2-197cda3339e9", "text": "我很担心你的健康。", "shortMeaning": "我很为你的健康担心。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f2f21e0a-4240-4606-b81e-ce026f19cc50", "text": "我很担心我作这份新工作就不会做得好。", "shortMeaning": "我很担心这份新工作我做不好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:55d89f88-2ba8-4b9a-8a1c-2653a3678e21", "text": "我很担心我儿子的安全。", "shortMeaning": "我很担心儿子的安全。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9eb83099-e032-449e-ac43-7a3559605ce8", "text": "我很晚才到了哈尔滨，等出租汽车的队伍已经长极了。", "shortMeaning": "我很晚才到哈尔滨，等出租车的队伍已经很长。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:30b917e3-3539-41f4-b42a-32e442989c0b", "text": "我很期待下周日能再见到你。", "shortMeaning": "我很期待下周日再见到你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:49191c22-10bb-4cf8-8e8d-1b990ee837d6", "text": "我很期待在山中安静地过周末。", "shortMeaning": "我很期待在山里安静地过周末。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2e70eb84-e262-4a5f-92e3-6d76133ac340", "text": "我很气恼，因为它不在那。", "shortMeaning": "我很气恼，因为它不在那里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:017d43e6-65ef-4f3c-a269-a32e6948b0ef", "text": "我很渴，想喝点冷饮。", "shortMeaning": "我很渴，想喝点凉的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:82db4004-e880-44bf-847a-213a95fb50d3", "text": "我很满意我的新外套。", "shortMeaning": "我对新外套很满意。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2c6b045a-e13f-445f-af4e-d4e6b4ae728e", "text": "我很爱她但是她不爱我。", "shortMeaning": "我很爱她，但她不爱我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:366a9b55-e8e2-482a-b7f6-67d6ccee9614", "text": "我很疑惑为什么冷的时候会寂寞得想找个人聊聊天。", "shortMeaning": "我疑惑为什么冷时寂寞得想找人聊天。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b174f9ac-6847-4211-8a7d-7ac904bc8af0", "text": "我很确定你也会为我做同样的事。", "shortMeaning": "我确信你也会为我这么做。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0eae90df-0b42-49d4-a434-1b200f3b603c", "text": "我很累所以早睡了。", "shortMeaning": "我很累，所以早睡了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e41b26fb-01c4-4e8b-9bfc-4429bbe26e65", "text": "我很累，但我还是没办法入睡。", "shortMeaning": "我很累，却还是睡不着。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8df2fc60-3779-48bc-9001-1ead1ac92f50", "text": "我很累，但无法让自己入睡。", "shortMeaning": "我很累，但无法入睡。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:61dd2470-ffb8-4393-8d52-627e8e21f092", "text": "我很累，早早就上床了。", "shortMeaning": "我很累，早早就睡了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c9ee45ed-979b-42d5-97aa-09ebef23e28b", "text": "我很累，还有点心烦。", "shortMeaning": "我很累，还有点烦。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4f0e7143-966b-41d3-b71b-0c0f1c9af8c7", "text": "我很羡慕你现在的生活。", "shortMeaning": "我很羡慕你现在的日子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:10b66eb4-00cc-452b-b9bc-6d60091a981e", "text": "我很耐心地听着，但不感兴趣。", "shortMeaning": "我耐心听着，但不感兴趣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0d85e535-9ee0-4c84-b300-9d23800bd9d2", "text": "我很遗憾您没有和我们一起来。", "shortMeaning": "很遗憾您没和我们一起来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e0d22db3-9808-4dae-b388-7f5db70bc06d", "text": "我很遗憾每次离开的时候，都没有好好地道别。", "shortMeaning": "我遗憾每次离开时都没好好道别。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b1d5ac9-e023-4209-b90a-13278fd5b12b", "text": "我很遗憾没去凡尔赛。", "shortMeaning": "没去凡尔赛我很遗憾。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fab04120-ab8d-4399-b9d9-9b14a611e9ff", "text": "我很钦佩他的慷慨大方。", "shortMeaning": "我很钦佩他的慷慨。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6c960119-16e9-4ea2-b8c1-64e194842ecc", "text": "我很钦佩他的才干。", "shortMeaning": "我很佩服他的才干。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6ca9dc09-9e8d-40b5-ac8a-a346b716735a", "text": "我很难读懂这本书。", "shortMeaning": "这本书我很难读懂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4fb47445-a5d5-4318-a174-790f1dd2138c", "text": "我很饿，可我又不想吃东西。", "shortMeaning": "我很饿，却又不想吃东西。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:25cfea1d-0479-44c9-b56a-8376585e53c1", "text": "我很高兴你今天来了。", "shortMeaning": "你来了我很高兴。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a905caa3-0057-423c-8b05-d32de446ef8d", "text": "我很高兴我们录用了你来担任这份工作。", "shortMeaning": "我很高兴录用你来做这份工作。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dfc167b4-6664-4ca9-82d8-d6ad555ce812", "text": "我得了一种一到周一就没精神的病。", "shortMeaning": "我得了周一就犯困的病。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5de14a17-e86b-48bf-b7ae-15efa4cd3054", "text": "我得去眼镜店配眼镜。", "shortMeaning": "我要去眼镜店配镜。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:07dcccdd-cec3-470d-912f-5024923ad2d8", "text": "我得在八月上法语和荷兰语网课。", "shortMeaning": "八月我要上法语和荷兰语网课。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6826f0d1-8f0a-4fae-9854-c134ad776674", "text": "我得找人商量一下。", "shortMeaning": "我要找人商量商量。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bcbc4093-9e86-4143-86ff-822824257479", "text": "我得找点有意思的事做。", "shortMeaning": "我要找点有趣的事做。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7aa1879c-a622-494e-bed9-b8d0525e08f0", "text": "我得推我的自行车，因为有个轮胎漏气了。", "shortMeaning": "我得推自行车，因为有只轮胎漏气了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:79b610ec-ca0d-473b-bfb0-e2fa0231f106", "text": "我得查找一下我的笔。", "shortMeaning": "我得找找我的笔。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:75b3e8d9-bbef-4f80-a882-8d6ba600c3ec", "text": "我得问你做那件事。", "shortMeaning": "我得请你做那件事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:01285942-abc9-49cf-aed3-9617107aeab5", "text": "我心情一直不太好。", "shortMeaning": "我心情一直不好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8437791e-4a46-472a-9d4e-5b730f4b34b6", "text": "我必须不惜一切代价帮助她。", "shortMeaning": "我必须不惜一切代价帮她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1cdf0285-65d0-47fe-beb3-9a6948782d64", "text": "我必须修理我的自行车。", "shortMeaning": "我得修我的自行车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b02588cd-3680-4789-8d3d-7788d460e2ba", "text": "我必须停止吃那么甜的冰激凌。", "shortMeaning": "我得停止吃那么甜的冰激凌。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:74e6e0da-0f82-4ac4-af24-e5b41675016c", "text": "我必须决定做什么。", "shortMeaning": "我得决定做什么。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3d23e35b-423a-434e-aa5b-02933df19a7b", "text": "我必须努力工作以追回失去的时间。", "shortMeaning": "我必须努力工作追回失去的时间。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2633bf62-4db6-40a1-9a6f-64916cf18770", "text": "我必须去修理我的自行车了。", "shortMeaning": "我得去修自行车了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b58149d4-f43b-47f9-bd0d-5afb8f0e3b74", "text": "我必须去看点小说了，不然我什么都写不出来。", "shortMeaning": "我得去看点小说，否则什么都写不出来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e631dcd2-e6f1-4a12-b6d1-dbcdf6aea531", "text": "我必须去睡觉了！我明天早上有课。", "shortMeaning": "我得去睡了！明早有课。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:65d59292-67bd-45c3-9398-f179ee14a88d", "text": "我必须发表一段演讲吗？", "shortMeaning": "我必须做演讲吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1b6c8712-b4bb-4894-ab96-e16643dad554", "text": "我必须向你承认我打呼。。。", "shortMeaning": "我必须向你承认我打呼噜。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9ebfdcde-20b6-4ecc-b1dd-0045a6164500", "text": "我必须在礼拜六之前把书还回去。", "shortMeaning": "我必须在周六前还书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0e851832-9c2a-45e3-9a7e-d25466825ead", "text": "我必须好好练习写作了。", "shortMeaning": "我得好好练写作了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:73648eaf-1c75-4e5c-8e7d-0ab5662ea3f2", "text": "我必须拿我的双簧管去修理。", "shortMeaning": "我得拿双簧管去修。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0a8eca26-2a3d-494a-9ad5-19a2feec5dd6", "text": "我必须推掉这任务，因为我不能胜任。", "shortMeaning": "我得推掉这任务，因为不能胜任。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:74464ffb-c77c-49a8-bfd6-9d29d202388d", "text": "我必须早点睡，不然我第二天根本起不来。", "shortMeaning": "我得早点睡，否则第二天起不来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a6a9bc1d-1578-473e-bd39-b83f3b0b5625", "text": "我必须更新我的护照。", "shortMeaning": "我得更新护照。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:95e5ade6-75bd-406c-9f84-3e1b50b6aaad", "text": "我必须要换衣服，因为我现在穿的衣服不适合这个环境。", "shortMeaning": "我得换衣服，因为现在的穿着不适合这环境。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e2210baa-fad0-45dc-8cca-5b912446ebf2", "text": "我必须要澄清些事情。", "shortMeaning": "我得澄清一些事情。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ab3aab6f-43bc-4aeb-9a74-146d7aff07e3", "text": "我必须问你一个蠢问题。", "shortMeaning": "我得问你一个蠢问题。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:01d1e553-6b32-49cd-8379-c94f69990d12", "text": "我必须靠自己做所有事。", "shortMeaning": "我必须靠自己做完所有事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:49a7db76-7bed-48b3-9814-cf1dde671427", "text": "我必须马上和你说话。", "shortMeaning": "我得马上跟你谈谈。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:870e165e-e062-4af1-82b0-b1e55605a7f2", "text": "我忍不住取笑他的发型。", "shortMeaning": "我忍不住笑他的发型。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3169a2fe-0b33-4000-b6f4-a92ffc6acca5", "text": "我忘不了塔妮娜的脸。", "shortMeaning": "塔妮娜的脸我忘不了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4c65ca7c-f6d3-47e3-a58e-d47cff754e97", "text": "我忘了告诉你为什么我们在谈捐赠了。", "shortMeaning": "我忘了告诉你我们为什么谈捐赠。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3769e1e4-9ee0-48fb-af48-f581a709f4b5", "text": "我忘了我要说什么了。", "shortMeaning": "我忘了要说什么。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4089d237-3a47-4e94-a440-b8aef02f9ce6", "text": "我忘了把它添加到目录里了。", "shortMeaning": "我忘了把它加进目录。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0900a586-ba8a-4efd-a13c-066878707cbc", "text": "我忘了给福特先生打电话。", "shortMeaning": "我忘记给福特先生打电话了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fa70ca80-81e1-4068-b6d8-bed89e86450d", "text": "我忘记他叫什么了。", "shortMeaning": "我忘了他的名字。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b694b89d-2acf-4dbf-a668-dcd71cbe0de9", "text": "我忘记他叫什么名字了。", "shortMeaning": "我忘了他的名字叫什么。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6086c695-d396-4b34-8dbe-2826d0de13df", "text": "我忘记在信封上贴邮票了。", "shortMeaning": "我忘了在信封上贴邮票。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c97aaf97-748c-41d6-ab7f-ee71cac8101c", "text": "我忘记给抽屉上锁了。", "shortMeaning": "我忘了给抽屉上锁。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2eb5786c-409a-48bf-b020-c58eceb2a7cc", "text": "我忘记这是谁说的了。", "shortMeaning": "我忘了这是谁说的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7ca82ae7-6d0a-44f3-abf9-cd5134933530", "text": "我忘记锁上抽屉了。", "shortMeaning": "我忘了锁抽屉。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:77993967-7625-45bc-8283-c329d4a80877", "text": "我快要激动得说不出话来了。", "shortMeaning": "我快激动得说不出话来了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:29caea47-5518-4d87-8228-8f30e0dda30f", "text": "我忽然停下了脚步。", "shortMeaning": "我忽然停下脚步。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ef42cd35-b0bb-4539-a6ac-a9d239cb1673", "text": "我怀疑他是一名律师。", "shortMeaning": "我怀疑他是律师。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3614b1b2-e8cc-4fa2-912f-6df9dd263009", "text": "我怀疑他是不是够格管理这样的小组。", "shortMeaning": "我怀疑他是否够格管理这样的小组。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:33b35c9d-1b2b-4d72-97ea-a1ca3265324d", "text": "我怀疑他是否会来。", "shortMeaning": "我怀疑他会不会来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ac931c37-f07b-494f-b2e1-1a1280a0d223", "text": "我怀疑我是不是一个好作家。", "shortMeaning": "我怀疑自己是不是个好作家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:db951a7d-9a78-429e-b7a2-e63175092f0d", "text": "我怀疑我是不是为这个世界而生的。", "shortMeaning": "我怀疑自己是否生来属于这世界。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:da258a5f-2236-4090-851d-26e2dcef01d4", "text": "我怀疑有什么事在他身上发生了。", "shortMeaning": "我怀疑他身上出了什么事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f98e895f-6e89-4342-af8a-43393d830bbc", "text": "我怀疑这是辆黑车。", "shortMeaning": "我怀疑这是辆黑出租。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:df9d0c4b-f62e-4da1-bf6a-537038f0ae78", "text": "我怀疑那家酒馆的啤酒兑水了。", "shortMeaning": "我怀疑那家酒馆的啤酒兑了水。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f5a9b378-66cc-49a1-be5e-03511da5a18c", "text": "我怎么可能是机器人呢？机器人不会做梦。", "shortMeaning": "我不可能是机器人，机器人不做梦。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ace8a4e4-c384-436d-92f6-ba1d919ba533", "text": "我怎么就这么容易过敏啊？", "shortMeaning": "我怎么这么容易过敏啊？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:39f8a046-0bb7-431a-823b-58db40bb3b91", "text": "我怎么比得上你呢，你有个铁饭碗，饿不着！", "shortMeaning": "我哪比得上你，你有铁饭碗，饿不着！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1b849999-e483-4fae-a15e-ccf1f763a5c6", "text": "我怎么看不见他们？", "shortMeaning": "我怎么看不到他们？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2d02376a-99b8-4a71-89fc-096f151988f6", "text": "我怎么能忘记您交付我的任务？", "shortMeaning": "我怎能忘记您交给我的任务？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:355fbe07-3b27-47da-a6eb-0c0a747c5f34", "text": "我怎么都想不到我会遇到一个这么谈得来的男生？", "shortMeaning": "我没想到会遇到这么谈得来的男生。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7b035f73-74e0-4271-87a2-13963268609e", "text": "我怎样报名参加呢？", "shortMeaning": "我该怎样报名参加？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6f1b05f7-1561-486e-ba55-acf7e678d15a", "text": "我怕你没法跟她结婚。", "shortMeaning": "我担心你娶不了她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3c4dc467-0740-4ae4-85c6-a8178646cf40", "text": "我怕她可能得了腮腺炎。", "shortMeaning": "我担心她可能得了腮腺炎。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8df6fe69-ce6a-4994-9737-9543af87535c", "text": "我怕它是行不通的。", "shortMeaning": "我怕它行不通。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:72e2e083-8642-4f1e-bef7-ea759257b0de", "text": "我思考，所以我存在。", "shortMeaning": "我思，故我在。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f554ebb1-e2a1-48ce-9244-ac5f4cec8fbc", "text": "我总是为我的家庭骄傲。", "shortMeaning": "我总是为家庭骄傲。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3a9e6427-9d68-48e7-b402-9a87309b6325", "text": "我总是优先阅读体育版面。", "shortMeaning": "我总是先读体育版面。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8f908160-14c1-4e1d-983e-b0b62403c210", "text": "我总是会在表格的最后一列留下备注。", "shortMeaning": "我总会在表格最后一列留备注。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1ab6a48c-2a98-43eb-ae9c-a4f2d458065a", "text": "我总是在离手不远的地方放一本字典。", "shortMeaning": "我总在手边放一本字典。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2640b894-d610-4951-8030-a2a2477a74b7", "text": "我总是忘掉我昨晚做的梦。", "shortMeaning": "我总忘掉昨晚做的梦。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c3a03643-9440-4795-995c-4bfada4e96cb", "text": "我总是想有兄弟姐妹会怎么样。", "shortMeaning": "我总想有兄弟姐妹会怎样。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3d5dde24-d050-4d5e-921c-612869f29470", "text": "我总是觉得压力很大。", "shortMeaning": "我总觉得压力很大。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c2221b73-b28c-4b81-9a41-8d4fdf0839fa", "text": "我总觉得木偶戏有点吓人。", "shortMeaning": "我总觉得木偶戏有点可怕。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:940514df-cad6-405d-b504-ec54ac7af437", "text": "我恐怕不是个很好的伙伴。", "shortMeaning": "我恐怕不是个好伙伴。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:52e648c7-cca9-4e6c-ada6-177de85d5dfb", "text": "我恐怕你搞错了吧。", "shortMeaning": "我恐怕你搞错了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fe96c619-0945-4928-8fe2-0e254f0ab9d3", "text": "我恐怕您必须亲自去。", "shortMeaning": "我恐怕您得亲自去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:eb5802a4-f204-4ba9-9a1c-eddadf931da8", "text": "我恐怕您打错电话了。", "shortMeaning": "恐怕您打错电话了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0a5cdc82-0d98-42f1-8c60-1c5671794456", "text": "我恐怕现在必须走了。", "shortMeaning": "我恐怕现在得走了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9d353a58-83cd-4222-9d80-13893d8fcaff", "text": "我悄悄把信给了他。", "shortMeaning": "我偷偷把信给了他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a83a52b4-785f-4ebe-9f4f-efdcfd98f34d", "text": "我想, 在艰难的时候, 你想哭就使劲哭吧。", "shortMeaning": "我想，艰难时想哭就放声哭吧。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0d35fcdf-fb49-4bda-8669-417e2b459ba2", "text": "我想不到好的用户名。", "shortMeaning": "我想不出好的用户名。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:98c8d074-32ef-4940-acec-ceb76c54e8d0", "text": "我想不起他们的名字了。", "shortMeaning": "他们的名字我想不起来了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5ec26ea6-c43f-4edb-b12f-410d61a06e0e", "text": "我想不起他的名字了。", "shortMeaning": "他的名字我想不起来了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aeccc3b0-a3f1-48cb-866a-19eb72a4e67a", "text": "我想不起来我在哪儿买的了。", "shortMeaning": "我想不起在哪儿买的了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d36a21dd-75e1-4f23-ba6b-8f62e673828f", "text": "我想不起来这个机器怎么用了。", "shortMeaning": "我想不起这机器怎么用了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:55ea2cb9-61e7-4fc5-b9fd-5405e12f8807", "text": "我想不起那首歌的旋律。", "shortMeaning": "那首歌的旋律我想不起来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b7de07c2-534e-4d1f-9a63-00c19951017c", "text": "我想乘船周游世界。", "shortMeaning": "我想坐船环游世界。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f97da5f1-f19d-4712-b070-500d3144cb0b", "text": "我想买一个伸缩自如的折叠搁架。", "shortMeaning": "我想买一个伸缩自如的折叠架。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:36aebe6a-9ddb-435f-a617-e3d9f338773b", "text": "我想买一个新床单。", "shortMeaning": "我想买一条新床单。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:36d2ea19-2010-42ac-b7a5-ba4e2bd1776b", "text": "我想买一双滑雪靴。", "shortMeaning": "我想买双滑雪靴。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f73a9ab9-eec4-46ab-84df-8b731def2ca4", "text": "我想买一张坐到上海的单程机票。", "shortMeaning": "我想买一张去上海的单程机票。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:40516004-c634-4a9c-85ad-ab40294738c2", "text": "我想买一辆新的自行车。", "shortMeaning": "我想买一辆新自行车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9715a005-525d-4b0c-91b7-997d9ee55a51", "text": "我想买十二个甜甜圈。", "shortMeaning": "我想买一打甜甜圈。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a88c789c-f0ca-409c-9be2-6ca9dc124c65", "text": "我想买这个玩具娃娃。", "shortMeaning": "我想买这个洋娃娃。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a59dfbab-c24e-4ccc-8cd7-a577c08f06c1", "text": "我想介绍你给他认识。", "shortMeaning": "我想把你介绍给他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3b486f26-fa26-45e6-b609-059f57e209fd", "text": "我想他不是中国人。", "shortMeaning": "我猜他不是中国人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4106d2cf-a3d9-4fd3-b935-acc98e384854", "text": "我想他会很快回来的。", "shortMeaning": "我想他会很快回来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:34907a11-803e-45b8-b5a8-e60fa90013d5", "text": "我想你。我需要见你。我能来吗？", "shortMeaning": "我想你，需要见你，我能来吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5074db71-12c2-4a27-8099-2d8ce9f3967a", "text": "我想你不会那么做的吧。", "shortMeaning": "我想你不会那么做吧。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7e90f131-6893-4c07-b346-d8b859b48424", "text": "我想你和我待在一起。", "shortMeaning": "我想让你陪我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:245230af-e080-47cb-9411-611b466fdac7", "text": "我想你坐到我的座位了。", "shortMeaning": "我想你坐了我的座位。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d210e873-3aa0-4085-b9bd-1dea3e50e149", "text": "我想你将眼光放得更长远一点就会不一样了。", "shortMeaning": "我想你把眼光放长远些就会不同。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7af16618-6a67-450f-8f33-83e0421506b0", "text": "我想你待在这里直到我回来。", "shortMeaning": "你待在这里等我回来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ed86c0f5-01d5-448e-974a-694c754af2ab", "text": "我想你把真相告诉我。", "shortMeaning": "我想你告诉我真相。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b9538399-b645-4fdd-a9bc-37ea4d3d4b41", "text": "我想你是唯一一个需要帮助的人。", "shortMeaning": "我想你是唯一需要帮助的人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b78b525e-a64b-4afb-bf31-10265cee22ed", "text": "我想你用自己的想象力。", "shortMeaning": "我想你发挥自己的想象力。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9c600c76-38f6-4144-8156-46a971deb8ec", "text": "我想你的生活除了工作，应该还有别的好玩的。", "shortMeaning": "我想你的生活除了工作还应有别的乐趣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4ca70088-b6b6-4624-b280-cdb76a9a90fb", "text": "我想你等我等到7点下班。", "shortMeaning": "我想你等我到七点下班。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b3db18fd-be12-48ef-89dd-2207b5c1ef6c", "text": "我想你表现我怎么做那个。", "shortMeaning": "我想你示范一下怎么做那个。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:670d5867-4650-46b8-adf6-ae70409d167e", "text": "我想你要拿到驾照根本不难。", "shortMeaning": "我想你拿驾照根本不难。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8e79ea11-b41c-4b1a-888f-13c30cb6dae9", "text": "我想你读一下这封信。", "shortMeaning": "请你读一下这封信。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:22e111e7-2e35-42c4-862c-2541f40b37ca", "text": "我想你迟早会知道在桌面建立一个快捷方式是有多方便。", "shortMeaning": "我想你迟早会知道桌面建快捷方式有多方便。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f6ca4f71-2feb-4d88-8140-112869e1d399", "text": "我想借你的笔记用一下。", "shortMeaning": "我想借你的笔记用用。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:53bd7f09-b486-4264-882b-1e036df5e68c", "text": "我想做一个程序员。", "shortMeaning": "我想当程序员。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b7d72737-09f4-47c6-b749-c8191900d3c6", "text": "我想关闭我的储蓄账户。", "shortMeaning": "我想关掉储蓄账户。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7df7cb07-7976-4453-b89f-d95263e7448b", "text": "我想再多看一出戏。", "shortMeaning": "我想再看一出戏。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:756e67c8-3d52-427d-ab95-8e7713ceb0ed", "text": "我想再来一杯啤酒。", "shortMeaning": "我再要一杯啤酒。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0f406fee-58a7-43f3-8b4f-84ae7f3ef827", "text": "我想再次回到我的童年。", "shortMeaning": "我想再回到童年。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a16585e1-aa33-4452-8a3c-cdcade54e721", "text": "我想再次见到他们。", "shortMeaning": "我想再见到他们。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:53c49f77-1551-41ea-aef1-bf29fd9aeeb2", "text": "我想写一个火狐插件。", "shortMeaning": "我想做个火狐插件。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0c5c7d68-0196-4bc9-888f-5f576b77e5d0", "text": "我想写一首诗送给你。", "shortMeaning": "我想写首诗送给你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:986a4d6c-2460-437a-a885-f97ffe030e09", "text": "我想写短文，但没灵感了。", "shortMeaning": "我想写短文，却没灵感。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ff97dc25-71b2-4a46-bd4b-3f5befdd27c5", "text": "我想到了一个主意。", "shortMeaning": "我想到个主意。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0c8f5389-0f05-4580-8000-a94913173bb0", "text": "我想办法克服了对别人吹毛求疵的毛病。", "shortMeaning": "我想办法改掉了吹毛求疵的毛病。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a63b80ec-7ae4-4e24-a4fa-d2c24c72ec25", "text": "我想加入你们的团对。", "shortMeaning": "我想加入你们的团队。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bd63dae3-fba6-42ae-a8f5-e676cf210761", "text": "我想加入群聊，麻烦同意一下。", "shortMeaning": "我想加入群聊，麻烦通过一下。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f2a694a7-0299-4a03-b551-9765c4e519d8", "text": "我想单独和你聊聊。", "shortMeaning": "我想单独找你谈谈。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cac507ac-d1fc-4677-99af-c9f9f6471556", "text": "我想去买个优盘，你和我一起去行吗？", "shortMeaning": "我想去买个便携存储盘，你能陪我去吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b5ad9d1a-bae2-486b-9c15-aa309d460331", "text": "我想去你要去的地方。", "shortMeaning": "我想跟你去同一个地方。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4804d345-7d42-4c51-b4c3-f243d885d20c", "text": "我想去加拿大读大学。", "shortMeaning": "我想去加拿大上大学。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:21fe29a7-7c38-434a-b205-94f75776cd6a", "text": "我想去另一个世界。", "shortMeaning": "我想去往另一个世界。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1f7c7776-f07a-4b11-94bc-d3c5a6a0979f", "text": "我想去吃个冰淇淋。", "shortMeaning": "我想去吃冰激凌。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cccf3c58-2cae-4c7f-a8d8-1bd3effc0323", "text": "我想去和他们谈谈。", "shortMeaning": "我想去跟他们谈谈。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a897654d-1c5d-449e-96df-5419b8c65dcb", "text": "我想去跟他们谈谈。", "shortMeaning": "我想去和他们谈谈。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3f3cdf1a-9956-4456-92a3-38200a686ced", "text": "我想变富，不再因钱忧心忡忡。", "shortMeaning": "我想变富，不再为钱发愁。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7400ff8f-082e-413b-a24e-e2ff94973fa9", "text": "我想变得和您一样聪明。", "shortMeaning": "我想像您一样聪明。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9c2422ab-ce34-44f4-a6e9-b63189977bf2", "text": "我想吃一道法国菜。", "shortMeaning": "我想吃道法国菜。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fb4246e3-3eeb-474e-9649-250ca899582d", "text": "我想吃点不甜的东西。", "shortMeaning": "我想吃点不甜的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:948b5958-460f-4362-a395-e0d3314bc1e1", "text": "我想向你们租一间屋子住。", "shortMeaning": "我想向你们租间屋子住。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e7cca600-29b0-43cc-9c98-be0d93889466", "text": "我想向你打听点他的事。", "shortMeaning": "我想跟你打听他的事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3c8239cd-d128-42c2-894f-1853eb57db8c", "text": "我想听听关于你的事情。", "shortMeaning": "我想听听你的事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e4c47188-689b-4e60-9913-b7c66a44f619", "text": "我想听日本的音乐。", "shortMeaning": "我想听日本音乐。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3ae2d7ac-b1fd-4fd9-b26f-0b7b9e8cfa4c", "text": "我想呆在家多过钓鱼。", "shortMeaning": "我宁愿待在家也不去钓鱼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f3868e0b-d3d7-44c1-813c-cb6e25fc4a76", "text": "我想和一个像她那样的女孩结婚。", "shortMeaning": "我想和像她那样的女孩结婚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c56254dd-8a67-42a3-bd83-6b8457e06d27", "text": "我想和他一起去约会。", "shortMeaning": "我想和他去约会。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b5c7fb2d-22c2-45d7-a6ae-011f06482592", "text": "我想和你一起去音乐会。", "shortMeaning": "我想和你一起听音乐会。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8cf1344d-3e3a-469d-b43d-a1db4c0ee33a", "text": "我想和你的舅舅谈一谈。", "shortMeaning": "我想和你舅舅谈谈。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:35578585-a97c-4fe2-92b9-fda9cb80dff5", "text": "我想和你讨论一些事情。", "shortMeaning": "我想和你讨论些事情。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6442bfbc-e71b-4a4a-8952-7ee53ee378d8", "text": "我想和你说点重要的事。", "shortMeaning": "我想跟你说件重要的事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:70ee023d-44dc-4287-a667-e39a0e3e75ba", "text": "我想和你谈谈价钱。", "shortMeaning": "我想跟你谈价格。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5aaaa2cc-5955-4136-8b35-44b15ed5c67a", "text": "我想和她一起去看电影。", "shortMeaning": "我想跟她去看电影。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0591aa15-3c36-430f-9609-94b79a6d3b5f", "text": "我想咨询点儿事情。", "shortMeaning": "我想咨询点事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:235bb232-db38-4fcd-8415-0437a5f071ca", "text": "我想在买之前先试试这个新机型。", "shortMeaning": "我想买之前先试试这个新机型。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f86b32ca-c334-4508-bbb9-4a10887ddb15", "text": "我想在你回来之前我就已经走了吧。", "shortMeaning": "我想在你回来前我已经走了吧。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:363d8822-9ef6-4f3a-a39d-20c1fe80b1c5", "text": "我想在这儿待几天。", "shortMeaning": "我想在这里住几天。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:02d63257-69dd-489b-a13a-58b00d46bf2e", "text": "我想在这里再待一会。", "shortMeaning": "我想在这儿再待一会儿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:913be03e-a5e5-4ad2-99a4-15f5b55abf30", "text": "我想在银行关门之前赶到那里。", "shortMeaning": "我想在银行关门前赶到那里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:03c2f8b9-792d-47f2-b9b5-aa0c7375c99f", "text": "我想多了解一下他。", "shortMeaning": "我想多了解他一些。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:616052ad-3ae0-427a-9f67-ea746306eeeb", "text": "我想她不会在家里。", "shortMeaning": "我想她不会在家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5499fd1d-dc28-484e-9ae4-80dc0c009845", "text": "我想她和我一起来。", "shortMeaning": "我想让她和我一起来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:898e0699-2827-4bc7-91d4-781285bf8bd7", "text": "我想她对你有兴趣。", "shortMeaning": "我猜她对你有好感。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ac35b6e3-5969-4597-b601-ef43b654e8e7", "text": "我想她肯定有其他技能。", "shortMeaning": "我想她肯定还有其他技能。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4e8898b6-fe4a-4cd8-b151-b8a7b34f187e", "text": "我想学标准的英语。", "shortMeaning": "我想学标准英语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9c511e07-5560-4294-b334-b599311bfb95", "text": "我想学汉语和日语。", "shortMeaning": "我想学汉语还有日语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:915ac21d-6b99-426a-86c2-430f893896d7", "text": "我想学汉语，还想去中国。", "shortMeaning": "我想学汉语，也想去中国。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2c462180-53f4-46d7-9883-0e597ab90d8a", "text": "我想学罗马尼亚语。", "shortMeaning": "我想学罗马尼亚文。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f74f223b-89b9-47c0-a7cd-1d62e96a4ecd", "text": "我想学钢琴，吉它或长笛。", "shortMeaning": "我想学钢琴、吉他或长笛。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2d51ddf0-9f16-4387-8742-6dc992736be8", "text": "我想家了，所以就回去了。", "shortMeaning": "我想家了，就回去了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:47ebb9b4-4b77-49f4-a755-44fe9c333013", "text": "我想尽快从这个不透气的屋子里出去。", "shortMeaning": "我想尽快离开这间不透气的屋子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
